WEBVTT

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.780
Hey, Princess and the others are okay too.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.300
I'm not okay...

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:48.090
That was rough, but you forgot
that you were seasick, didn't you?

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.000
How could I?!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.290
No, I'm not gonna make it...

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.230
Just stay still.

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:59.100
We're close enough to the city that the ship will sail there by itself.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:41.760
Reishin, what are you doing here?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.830
Yuushun, I'm warning you once more. Resign your position.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.920
No.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.770
Give it up!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.520
No.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:53.520
That stupid Emperor has no right to be your master!

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.940
He didn't even notice your condition!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.320
That's because I made sure he wouldn't notice.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.950
Even so, he should have!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.820
He's gone to Ranshuu?

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.330
Why did you permit him to do something so foolish?!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.260
Because I thought that's what the Emperor needed right now.

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.590
Some quiet time, more than anything else.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:21.630
That snotty-nosed kid may never return. Kyuusai Cove is that sort of place.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.230
So I hear.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.260
Nonetheless, I'll just wait here.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:31.740
As I've said a number of times, I'll never give up my position.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:41.360
"I didn't do anything wrong." That's what I've been telling myself, but...

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.960
To you as a person?

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.870
Or as the Emperor?

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:49.370
Fine, go ahead.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:55.060
I'm supposed to be free here, released from everything, yet...

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.830
I'm in pain, even more than when I was in the palace.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.390
Shuurei? No...

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.840
I, well, umm...

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.880
Shuurei didn't run...

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.830
She never did in any situation, but I...

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.720
Ryuuki-sama,

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:30.160
isn't it painful to run away?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.610
I-It is painful.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:44.220
I've run away, leaving Yuushun all alone, abandoning all my duties and responsibilities.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:49.180
That's why I'm in such pain. It hurts. It hurts so much.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.410
Have a pleasant journey, my lord.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.440
Please come back safely.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:59.460
I'm not an Emperor, but I didn't want to admit it.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.900
That's why I ran away.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:12.230
Perhaps I can never return. What should I do?

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:15.370
What should I do, Shuurei?

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.220
Ryuuki? Is he crying?

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:36.900
Hey, you...

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.930
You know the real reason why I came along, don't you?

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:41.880
I guess.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.860
Princess is lucky that you're with her,

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.660
rather than Seiran or me.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:54.940
That bamboo-shooting family retainer worships oujo-sama, and so do you, I guess.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.250
Yeah, sort of.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:01.960
But that doesn't apply to me. I'd never choose that woman.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.260
I'm an ordinary person. I'm not "special."

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.520
That's why you're good for her.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:15.270
You subconciously know how to draw out Princess's optimal strength.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:23.010
Once this trip is over, I'll leave you and that
bamboo-shooting family retainer to attend to her.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.750
Wow, it's beautiful!

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:37.200
I've heard stories about this place, but it's just what I expected of Gyokuryuu, the capital of Ranshuu.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:45.770
Damn it, it's better than Sashuu — no, even better than Kiyou.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.600
Don't you think it's a beautiful city?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.850
You've come rather openly for an
"undercover" inspector, haven't you?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.600
You must be...

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:01.100
Indeed, I'm the governor of Ranshuu, Kyou Bunchuu.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.360
You're the first undercover inspector to visit since Riku Seiga.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.110
Inspector Riku has been here?

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:15.010
He's undertaken various projects, but his investigation was mainly focused on the Shiba family.

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:16.880
The Shiba family.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:25.730
I'm such a fool. That document was there, obviously because someone investigated it before!

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:30.340
So, Inspector Kou, what do you want to investigate?

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:36.220
Please keep the information I tell you confidential.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:40.010
I need you to find someone quickly.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.230
I'll be relying on you.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.860
We'll search for him immediately.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:52.240
I'll also give you permission to stay in Gyokuryuu during that period.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.740
Thank you.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.320
Everyone, listen up!

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:02.160
The Emperor is paying an incognito visit to Ranshuu.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.300
What?

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.250
The Emperor is here?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.540
Where in Ranshuu is he?

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.780
Our task is to find that out.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:14.060
Send out an order to every checkpoint in Ranshuu to follow the Emperor's route.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:17.800
Now, keep this confidential, you got that?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.560
Yes, sir!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.190
Why now?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:30.160
I don't know the details, but I never imagined that the Emperor was so foolish

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.490
as to leave his throne at a time like this.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:38.300
Let's wait for the report from Governor Kyou about His Highness.

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:41.830
We'll work on other matters while we can.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.340
Ensei will investigate the salt case,

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.640
Tan-tan will examine the personnel management records of government and military officials

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.260
in both the district and smaller prefectures.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.380
Please gather as many details as possible.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.800
Why salt and personnel management?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.120
We've come all the way down to Ranshuu.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:01.140
We might as well investigate the issues that concern us as much as we can.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.800
Oh, I see.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.800
Okay, so I'll work on salt.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.990
What, really? You understood just from that?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:12.940
Judging from your face, I thought you were just as stupid as me!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.050
Tan-tan, you're so honest, aren't you?

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:21.220
Don't worry. I'm really stupid too, probably just as much as you.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.460
Stop lying!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.660
It's true, honest.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.100
I understood from intuition.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.120
Intuition?

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:30.180
I did work as a provincial governor for ten years, after all.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:33.130
I can kind of tell what to go after.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.840
This kind of stuff is really about experience.

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:39.840
Oh, I see. Stupidity can be overcome by experience.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.070
Right, if you've understood your task, let's move it.

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:45.980
Now, we'll start!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.510
Right!

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:49.480
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.480
Okay, then I'll work on...

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.480
That's strange.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:10:02.030
Even though he's the eldest son of the distinguished Shiba family, there isn't much information about him.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.040
Shiba Jin...

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:10.810
At the age of 21, he murdered his father and turned himself in to the Ranshuu prefecture.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:15.990
The motive for the murder was never discovered, and he was sentenced to death.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:18.990
That's odd.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.430
If he committed that sort of crime, he should've been sent to Kiyou,

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.810
but Jin-san was sentenced at the provincial prefecture.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.610
Why?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.200
What if the Ran family desperately wanted to save Jin-san,

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.920
pressured the provincial prefecture, and let him escape?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.970
This is impossible. The report was so half-hearted.

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.950
Who on earth wrote this?!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.120
What?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.200
The report was written by the provincial governor himself.

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.840
When this case happened,

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.590
the Director General of the Section of Government Inspection was visiting Ranshuu as well.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:58.130
The Director General at that time was...

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.760
Ou Ki!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.420
Jin...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.970
Please don't apologize, Jin!

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.990
Jyuusan-hime?

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.090
Jyuusan-hime, are you all right?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.230
I was resting, and...

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.590
I thought you were having a nightmare, so...

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:46.350
I'm sorry. I pointed my blade at the Emperor, of all people.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.370
Was it a bad dream?

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:53.650
You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.650
Did I... say something?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:01.240
Umm... well... you said, "Please don't apologize, Jin."

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.250
I-I'll pretend I didn't hear anything.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.330
I heard nothing, okay?

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.640
Please rest some more.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:12.370
Stay here until you feel better.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.670
Emperor.

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:21.630
I told you before that there's a man whom I love.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.630
And Jin is that man?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.960
I was three years old when I first met him.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.210
My mother had been murdered.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.290
Are you Jyuusan-hime?

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:04.800
For three days and three nights, we just sat facing each other.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.890
Will you let me come closer to you?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:23.480
Your eyes... If you give me your eyes, I'll let you come closer.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.310
Fine, I'll give them to you.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:39.960
Stop it!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.020
I'm sorry, I'm so sorry!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.380
You're not an ogre!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.880
I've come to take you away.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:55.480
Let's go, thirteenth princess of the Ran family.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.380
I'm Jin. Shiba Jin.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:06.850
In truth, Jin had been ordered to kill me,

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:08.490
but he didn't.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:13.810
Jin and I were left with his grandfather, because he'd disobeyed his father.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.460
I did everything with Jin.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:27.060
Shuuei-nii-sama came to play with us a lot.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:31.640
My favorite times were when the three of us were together.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:39.520
Hotaru, when you turn 16, you'll be my wife.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.270
What?

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.270
At first, I thought he was joking.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.770
Listen carefully, Hotaru.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:50.410
If anyone is to be my wife, you're my only choice. Always were, and always will be.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:59.280
If I had Jin's heart, and we supported each other, I thought we'd be happy.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:00.320
But...

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.920
Jin was sentenced to death for murdering his own father.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.090
Hotaru...

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.390
I'm sorry. Forgive me.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.710
Please don't apologize, Jin!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.640
I don't want to hear it anymore!

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:30.950
I robbed Jin of everything.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:42.330
You can't become happy just because you love someone.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.640
You must choose paths that you won't regret.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.090
Be honest to your feelings.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.220
We're going to camp here tonight?

00:15:59.220 --> 00:15:59.970
Yes.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.580
We'll be in Kyuusai Cove by tomorrow.

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.810
Kyuusai Cove?!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.690
That's right.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:10.650
Isn't Shuuei's home in Gyokuryuu?

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:14.160
Gyokuryuu is in that direction.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.490
What you can see over there is the Garyuu
mountain range, where Kyuusai Cove is located.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.200
So Shuuei is in Kyuusai Cove?

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.290
What should I do? I was told that Kyuusai Cove would bring me bad luck, but...

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.350
It's too late now.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:31.420
We'll soon reach the river that leads to Kyuusai Cove,

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.800
and then we'll leave our ship and start climbing up the mountain!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.550
M-Mountain?!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:38.020
Yes, that Ryuumin mountain.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.210
That mountain over there is Houkyou, where the Hyou family's shrine is situated.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.890
Houkyou Mountain... I've heard of it somewhere.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.560
Oh! Could it be...

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:53.820
Yes, it's the Houkyou mountain that I told you about long ago.

00:16:54.190 --> 00:17:00.550
Many members of the royal family have gone there. Some returned, but others didn't.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:04.330
The ones who returned became Emperors and brought prosperity to the country.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:10.840
Only the true Emperor can reach the Hyou family's shrine on Houkyou Mountain.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.800
You'll be tested by the Sai Hassen for your potential as Emperor.

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.510
It's called the Valley of the Lost.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:24.530
Strangely enough, the five brothers of the Ran family never get lost in there.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.810
Is that so?

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:30.410
Anyway, ordinary people shouldn't try.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:35.100
It's said that if you reach the shrine on
Hyoukyou Mountain, your wish will come true,

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:38.230
so people keep on climbing the mountain in secret, but...

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.080
Your wish... comes true.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.600
Emperor?

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.840
Shouka-sama?

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:05.680
You're kidding me.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:14.570
The Emperor has entered Kyuusai Cove?

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.150
Are you thinking of going, Shuuei?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.140
Brother...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.080
I ask you once more.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.080
Are you thinking of going?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.080
Yes, I am.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.820
Even if I forbid you?

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:33.380
Brother, you know why I've returned.

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:37.210
You're abandoning the Ran family and choosing the Emperor?

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:41.140
That foolish Emperor who decided to come here now, of all times?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.450
Don't we suit each other?

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.740
A stupid Emperor and his stupid vassal...

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:50.190
Even if the Ran family won't choose that Emperor, I choose him.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:54.330
You know that there's no way we'd allow it, don't you?

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.600
You know what it means to disobey us.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:02.200
I know, but brother, the Emperor has repeatedly said that he needs me.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.930
I thought...

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:08.140
What if something happens, like it did to Prince Seien?

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.990
I don't want to have regrets. I don't want to let the Emperor die.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:15.710
If that moment comes, I'll stay with him until the end.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:21.970
Shuuei, I won't let that inexperienced Emperor have you. Never.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.350
The Ran family does not approve of the Emperor.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:29.070
We'll talk about it again when I return.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.620
I'll let you know one thing.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:37.610
The shrine maiden that arrived on Houkyou Mountain...

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.860
is Shusui-san.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:13.060
If Jin-san is still alive, even after he was sentenced to death, then obviously someone helped him.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.560
On top of that,

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:19.250
if the man named Shun is Shiba Jin,

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:24.050
then he was the best friend of Ran-shogun and was the fiancé of Jyuusan-hime.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:29.890
They were close to each other, so it's only natural that I'd investigate their relationship,

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:31.240
but can I do it?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.580
Excuse me.

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.330
Have you found him?!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.800
We were too late.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.630
It appears the Emperor has already entered Kyuusai Cove.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.640
What?

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.220
Kyuusai Cove?!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:48.640
It's a forbidden land where the authorities have no jurisdictional power.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.810
What about scouring the mountain?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.210
They said they can't.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:56.310
If they carelessly send a search party,
the whole group goes missing.

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:59.080
Weren't you told by Director General Ki?

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.570
He said you weren't to go after the Emperor if he went to Kyuusai Cove.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:05.460
Sure I was, and by Governor Kyou as well.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.070
He says it brings misfortune.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.330
So, what's your plan, Princess?

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.660
What else can I do but go look for him?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.140
You are?!

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.060
Even if something bad might happen to you?

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:18.040
Even if you'll be fired when this is discovered?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.750
Someone precious to me might be lost on the mountain.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:25.260
If there's anything I can do to save him, then of course I'll do it!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.260
I thought you'd say that, Princess.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.520
Well then, we'll leave today!

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:36.720
Thank you so much for arranging matters for us.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.680
I won't stop you anymore.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.020
Please be careful.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:41.390
Yes, sir.

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:42.290
Now then...

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.410
Oh, just one more thing.

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:50.430
You know the place in Ranshuu where the locals throw dumplings into the river?

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:51.240
Was that...

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:55.400
Oh, you want to know the name of the undercover inspector who started it?

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.710
It was done by the current Secretary of the Department of Counsel, Ou Ki-sama.

00:22:06.770 --> 00:22:08.510
Are you sure about that?

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:14.690
In all ages and civilizations, great officials share one characteristic.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:20.360
They don't let people die because of foolish sayings and beliefs.

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:22.900
Like Ou Ki-sama and...

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.990
Inspector Kou too.

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:29.730
Without a moment of hesitation, she made a decision.

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:31.350
That in itself is something to value.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:34.910
True, it's not easily done.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:39.900
If such a great official would risk her life to rescue the Emperor,

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.860
then there's a good chance the Emperor will become a better person in the future.

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.420
At least, I think so.

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:56.560
Let's get moving, boatman!

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:58.810
To Kyuusai Cove at maximum speed!

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:07.820
Damn, it's Ryuuren.

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:12.210
I have heard the wish of my soul friend number one!

00:23:12.210 --> 00:23:14.650
I will fulfill your wish with all my power!

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:15.830
Let us take off!

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.790
Let's go to Kyuusai Cove!

00:24:46.790 --> 00:24:49.100
We'll look for indigo ducks and mushrooms shaped like monkey heads,

00:24:49.100 --> 00:24:51.750
as requested by the Director General of the Section of Government Inspection!

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:53.550
In passing, we'll look for Ryuuki, too!

00:24:53.550 --> 00:24:57.300
No, I mean, our main objective is to find Ryuuki!
